1
00:00:00,009 --> 00:00:01,639
- Morning.
- Morning. What's up?

2
00:00:01,803 --> 00:00:06,803
(Leonard:)Nothing. We just pulled an all-nighter
trying to fix a Zero-Gravity pasta maker.

3
00:00:09,144 --> 00:00:12,024
- I'm gonna make a coffee run. Want any?
- No. I have coffee.

4
00:00:12,188 --> 00:00:14,568
(Stuart:)Great,
so how'd it go with Stuart last night?

5
00:00:16,568 --> 00:00:18,278
I really don't wanna talk about it.

6
00:00:18,445 --> 00:00:19,985
(Leonard:)Yeah. Right. Sure.

7
00:00:20,155 --> 00:00:22,745
But, you know, the thing is,
before you guys went out...

8
00:00:22,907 --> 00:00:25,697
- ...I spoke to him and I...
- I said I don't wanna talk about it.

9
00:00:25,869 --> 00:00:27,949
- Okay, I kind of feel res...
- Look, Leonard.

10
00:00:28,121 --> 00:00:31,411
What goes on is none of your business.
So just leave it alone, okay?

11
00:00:36,254 --> 00:00:40,714
(Raj:)If you really want to clean up your karma,
go get my freaking latte.

12
00:00:48,516 --> 00:00:50,856
(Howard:)Hang on, I think I've got this.

13
00:00:51,019 --> 00:00:54,229
(Howard:)Help me see if we can wedge
this piece of PVC behind the support rod.

14
00:00:54,397 --> 00:00:58,067
You're overestimating the strength
of the substructure you're building.

